                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "b702314f-56f5-3b4e-b4d3-ed1992e30833",
                        "entry_id": "b98dbc38-75da-3e2b-9557-d585f34348da",
                        "glosses": [
                            "совокупность идей, идеологий и политических доктрин, направленных против коммунистических идей, идеологии и соответствующих политических течений и методов правления"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "386e9d48-0745-4348-b8f5-3c95f65a2401",
                                "sense_id": "b702314f-56f5-3b4e-b4d3-ed1992e30833",
                                "text": "Наш антикоммунизм, как выяснилось, как идеология крайне неустойчив, очень быстро растрачивает свои исходные моральные преимущества."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6c40e8a4-017b-4442-b4fc-291cdabf98d9",
                        "source_entry_id": "b98dbc38-75da-3e2b-9557-d585f34348da",
                        "source_sense_id": "b702314f-56f5-3b4e-b4d3-ed1992e30833",
                        "target_lang_word": "anticommunism",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "anticommunism",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f08d436e-070c-36c8-a2b6-ff4750eec41b",
                                        "entry_id": "a4c8a75d-622b-3cac-ab59-a9bf22a2785f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Opposition to communism."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1356689e-4edc-49e7-9d21-56092d26f17a",
                                                "sense_id": "f08d436e-070c-36c8-a2b6-ff4750eec41b",
                                                "text": "In the main, anticommunism in postwar America meant opposition to the kind of dictatorial state socialism that existed in Russia and that many Americans saw as a negation of everything America stood for. In the 1946 campaign, for example, when I talked about the \"communist-dominated PAC,\" my remarks were generally understood in this context of dictatorial socialism versus free enterprise."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
